OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Reform councillor to deny sex
OL,4,Aoffence charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FA suspended Reform UK councillor
OL,7,Findicated he will deny multiple charges
OL,8,Fof rape and sexual abuse as he appeared
OL,9,Fin court to face the allegations for
OL,10,Fthe first time.
OL,12,FGeorge Madgwick, 37, a Portsmouth city
OL,13,Fcouncillor, faces 12 counts of rape,
OL,14,Ftwo counts of sexual assault, two
OL,15,Fcounts of assault by penetration, two
OL,16,Fcounts of making and one count of
OL,17,Fdistributing indecent images of a
OL,18,Fchild, among other charges.
OL,20,FThey all relate to four alleged
OL,21,Fvictims, who were aged 16 and 17 at the
OL,22,Ftime, Hampshire police said.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
